  :title "ADR-2607101100: ENGI/EN 相互信用通貨 — kotobase-native 再設計(v1、推奨)"
  :status "accepted (v1 landed at kotoba-lang/engi, live-verified against production kotobase.net)"
  :doc_type "adr"
